<title>JAPAN: Ohmori plans share split.</title>
<headline>Ohmori plans share split.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ohmori Co Ltd said on Tuesday it planned a 1.1-for-1 share split on September 19, for shareholders as of July 31.</p>
